percent":"2.9%"},"total":{"numerator":30000,"percent":"3.0%"}},"postconditions":["The launcher holds zero HOOKEMON and zero USDC.","The funding allowance is exhausted from exactly 25,500 USDC to zero.","Treasury vesting holds exactly 10% of fixed supply and CycleVault holds exactly 500 USDC.","The exact reviewed PositionManager token ID belongs to the timelock, whose PoolKey-derived PoolId equals the canonical PoolId.","The hook project fee owner is CycleVault, the bridge adapter is bound to CycleVault, and CycleVault references the automatic distributor.","No mutable registrar authority or unallocated token balance remains after construction."],"rollback":"The USDC approval at nonce N is a separate transaction. The normal-CREATE launcher transaction at nonce N + 1 atomically reverts all child deployments, pool mutations, transfers, position minting, and factory registration if its constructor fails. That earlier allowance does not roll back; revoke it to zero, observe fresh state and nonces, then prepare any later authorized retry.","typedPreparationRequirement":"NORMAL_CREATE_TYPED_PREPARATION_REQUIRED: No trusted typed normal-CREATE preparation adapter/schema or end-to-end receipt currently binds the later public wallet, consecutive nonces, Solana ATA, token salt, hook salt, canonical PoolId, and PositionManager token ID. This descriptor is non-operational and does not resolve R3/R4."},"executablePlanBinding":{"contractName":"HookemonDeploymentPlan","domain":"HookemonDeploymentPlan.launcherInitCodeHash(plan)","requiredBindings":["hookFactory","approvalNonce","launcherNonce","tokenSalt","hookSalt","canonicalPoolId","expectedPositionTokenId","singlePrivyEthereumWallet","nonzeroSolanaOperatorUsdcAtaAndNftRecipient","exact25000LiquidityAnd500CycleVaultUsdcEconomics"],"sourceId":"source:primary","sourceSha256":"sha256:96f724ada3ec1826050e2c4cefe4c6bb57ff8ccb3fe8943528cf80cefe9e7509","sourceUnitName":"packages/contracts/script/HookemonDeploymentPlan.sol"},"fixedMainnet